{"ref":"BDB, עָדִין²","hw":"עָדִין²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָדִין</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  in <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי ע׳</span>, returned exiles <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:15\" href=\"/Ezra.2.15\">Ezr 2:15</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.20\">Ne 7:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:6\" href=\"/Ezra.8.6\">Ezr 8:6</a>, 𝔊 Αδ(δ)ιν, Ηδ(ε)ιν, etc.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a chief <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.17\">Ne 10:17</a>, 𝔊 Ηδ(ε)ιν, Αδειν.","next":"BDB, עֲדִינָא","prev":"BDB, עָדִין"}